  "description": "Introducing Richmond Gardens, a contemporary development offering sleek and spacious apartments in the vibrant heart of Fairview, Dublin3. Combining refined urban style with practical living, this community is perfectly placed for modern comfort. \n\nEach apartment features high-quality finishes, expansive open-plan living spaces filled with natural light, and integrated intercom access. The development includes ultrafast high-fibre broadband, secure underground parking, bicycle storage, and lush communal landscaped courtyards designed for relaxation and connection. \n\n \n\nKey Facilities & Features \n\nSpacious 1, 2, and 3-bedroom apartments \n\nPremium finishes throughout \n\nBright, open-plan living areas \n\nIntegrated intercom access \n\nExtensive communal landscaped courtyards \n\nSecure underground parking & bicycle storage \n\nUltrafast high-fibre broadband \n\n \n\nLocation Highlights \n\nRichmond Gardens sits in the heart of Fairview, with quick access to Drumcondra, Marino, Clontarf, and central Dublin: \n\nJust a 15-minute drive to Dublin Airport \n\nSurrounded by gyms, cafés, bars, and restaurants \n\nWalking proximity to CrokePark GAA Stadium & Hotel \n\nFairview Park, with its innovative children’s playground and green spaces, just a 5-minute walk away \n\nNearby creches, primary & secondary schools\n\nDirect access to Dublin City Centre \n\n \n\nTransport & Accessibility \n\nMultiple Dublin Bus routes nearby: 14, 15, 27, 27A, 27B, 29N, 42N, 123, 130 \n\nConvenient to the Dublin Port Tunnel for swift city access \n\nWalk Score: 75—good walkability for daily essentials \n\n \n\nSustainability \n\nEco-conscious features include: \n\nBER Ratings: B3–E2 \n\nOn-site recycling facilities with multiple waste streams \n\nActive resident engagement programmes \n\nBiodiversity initiatives enhancing the communal environment \n\n \n\nAbout IRES \n\nAs an IRES resident, you can be assured of: \n\nDedicated Property Manager \n\nReliable professional service when needed \n\nFully trained in-house staff \n\n24-hour on-call emergency support (e.g. loss of heat, water, essential services) \n\nClear communication via our resident portal \n\nLearn more at www.ires.ie \n\nNote: We aim to respond to all enquiries promptly; however, due to high volume, we may not reply individually to every message. \nFor more on our privacy practices, please visit our privacy statement: https://www.iresreit.ie/IRES-REIT-Privacy \n*Terms and conditions apply.",
